<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka closes steady vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka closes steady vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed steady at 42.5430/42.5490 to the dollar in interbank trading against the previous 42.5450/42.5490 close, dealers said.</p>
<p>Dealers said the taka, which opened firmer at 42.5350/42.5450, eased later on demand for dollars from importers.</p>
<p>The interbank call money rates closed easier at 4-5 percent against the previous 4.75-5.25 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
